  "findings": [
    "Preserved engine PATH ordering instead of allowing the image SDK directory to shadow another installed engine.",
    "Retained pre-session failure causes and classified Pi HTTP402 without exporting provider error text.",
    "Pi3 system launcher discarded PI_CODING_AGENT_DIR; fixture reproduced missing native provider. Existing corrected launcher selected through an isolated Pi entrypoint; no engine was installed.",
    "Pi3 account ownership required supported host reset-id; old registration retained.",
    "Pi4 first Codex probe timed out; post-restart native conversation and model switching passed. Exact upstream startup failure root cause was not established.",
    "Pi4 existing Claude automatically updated to 2.1.310; previous receipt was invalidated, and real reply plus two-model switching were reverified.",
    "Pi3 one final Codex verification had SERVER_UNREACHABLE; targeted retry succeeded. Final acceptance was ready on all three targets.",
    "All three final pods had both containers ready and zero container restarts. Earlier unacknowledged synthetic probe stop was accepted after restart."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "Only the two stated models per engine were exercised; 53 listed Pi models are not all verified.",
    "Claude Code uses the existing gateway with DeepSeek, which is not the officially supported Claude-only gateway path. Short reply tests do not establish full tool or long conversation compatibility.",
    "Pi4 persistent storage remains tight: approximately 0.9 GiB available after removing rebuildable download/build caches; user project data retained.",
    "No sustained load test, ARM64 or OIDC validation in this deployment."
  ]
